WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.703
Here is Scotty statue,
which is our CMU mascot.

2
00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:07.307
It was donated by our alumni back in 2021,

3
00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:10.310
and students usually rub its nose for good luck.

4
00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:14.214
But as we're currently standing outside
of the Cohen University Center,

5
00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:16.683
I would like to talk more
about student life here.

6
00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:21.121
In addition to Student Involvement and Traditions,
within Student Affairs,

7
00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:25.425
we also have, first,
Community Engagement &amp; Leadership Development,

8
00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.095
where students learn to lead and advocate
for positive changes

9
00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.832
through alternative breaks,
volunteer opportunities and mentorship.

10
00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:37.570
We also have Pittsburgh Engagement,
which houses and hosts various outdoor

11
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.708
adventures, arts and culture experiences
with subsidized tickets,

12
00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:46.708
and city connections within the 90 neighborhoods
all located around the city of Pittsburgh.

13
00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:51.151
We also have our Center for Student
Diversity and Inclusion,

14
00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:54.554
which is a student-centered space
supporting all students

15
00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.625
with a focus on community, leadership, and intersectional support.

16
00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:03.196
Programs include peer mentoring,
first-generation student initiatives

17
00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.565
and year-long community building events.

18
00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.935
Lastly, I want to talk about our Greek
life involvement.

19
00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.839
About 14% of our undergraduate students
participate

20
00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:17.544
within our different fraternities and
sororities across four different councils,

21
00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:21.114
and these organizations
play a really important role

22
00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.049
in campus traditions like Greek Sing,

23
00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.018
raising a lot of money last year for charity.

